	This is a very intriguing statement.  Are you blaming the metaphysics
for the bad epistemology?  Is Objectivist metaphysics completely or partially
*wrong*; or is it *incomplete*, but salvagable through amendment?


>> Essentials of Extropian Philosophy [More]
